flowchart TD
  A["Developer<br> (feature branch)"] -->|Create PR| B["Pull Request"]
  B --> C["CI: Validate PR<br>lint, unit tests, artifact checks"]
  C -->|If OK| D["Merge to main"]
  D --> E["CD: GitHub Actions<br>trigger on push to main"]
  E --> F["Resolve target workspace<br>env secrets / parameter.yml"]
  F --> G["Prepare artifacts<br>update notebook metadata / replace GUIDs"]
  G --> H["fabric-cicd: publish_all_items()<br>publish items from /fabric"]
  H --> I["Test Workspace<br>run smoke tests"]
  I --> J{Manual Approval Required?}
  J -->|Yes| K["Approval Gate<br>GitHub Environment reviewers"]
  K --> L["Deploy to Prod Workspace<br>fabric-cicd publish"]
  J -->|No| L
  L --> M["Post-deploy checks<br>smoke tests, audit logs"]
  M --> N["Done / Audit trail in Actions"]
